x;\n                                        background:;\"><div class=\"mq-editable-field mq-math-mode\" style=\"border: none; outline: none;\"><span class=\"mq-textarea\"><textarea autocapitalize=\"off\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" x-palm-disable-ste-all=\"true\" style=\"\" disabled=\"\"></textarea></span><span class=\"mq-root-block\" mathquill-block-id=\"57\"><span mathquill-command-id=\"59\" class=\"\">−</span><span mathquill-command-id=\"61\">2</span><span mathquill-command-id=\"63\">5</span></span></div></div> cubic centimeters per second.</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-buttonBar\"><div class=\"questionWidget-submitButton disabledButton\" style=\"display: none;\">Submit</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-spinnerFrame\"><div class=\"questionWidget-spinner\" style=\"display: block;\"></div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-result\"><div class=\"questionWidget-correctIncorrectIcon\"><img src=\"/img/correct-answer.svg\"></div><div class=\"questionWidget-correctText\">Correct</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanation\"><p>We use the forward difference approximation\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"365\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-msup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D449 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.413em; margin-left: 0.059em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-var\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2032\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D461 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c cl